// What fired a hit, so DamageUtility knows which of the attacker's source-specific multipliers
// applies. The owner can't answer this - it holds a weapon and skills at once, so only the shot
// itself knows. That's why Projectile and AreaOwner each carry one.
//
// There's deliberately no Area: a lingering area inherits the source that spawned it, so a dash's
// fire trail is Skill damage and a grenade's is Weapon damage.
enum DamageSource : Byte
{
    // No source-specific multiplier - enemy attacks, environment.
    None,
    Weapon,
    Skill
}
